OL,3,GNEWSA'Giant sex toy' Christmas tree is 
OL,4,Atalk of the town                       
OL,6,FA Christmas tree that has been likened 
OL,7,Fto a "giant sex toy" when lit up at    
OL,8,Fnight has become the most talked about 
OL,9,Ffestive centrepiece in years, a town   
OL,10,Fcentre business boss said.             
OL,12,FThe tree was unveiled at The Cornhill  
OL,13,Fin Ipswich on Sunday as part of the    
OL,14,Ftown's Christmas lights switch-on.     
OL,16,FWhile many branded the "fabulous"      
OL,17,Fannual event a success, others took to 
OL,18,Fsocial media to light-heartedly poke   
OL,19,Ffun at the "sexual" shape of the tree. 
