OL,3,GNEWSA'Giant sex toy' Christmas tree is 
OL,4,Atalk of the town                       
OL,6,FLee Walker, chief executive of Ipswich 
OL,7,FCentral, which put up the tree, told   
OL,8,Fthe BBC that he saw the funny side and 
OL,9,Fsaid, if nothing else, it had certainly
OL,10,Fgot people talking.                    
